						style="background: var(--aw-brand-gradient);"
					>
						<Image
							src={devPhoto}
							alt="Maija, the developer of Neverkin"
							class="w-full h-full rounded-full object-cover"
							width={128}
							height={128}
						/>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="text-center md:text-left">
					<p class="text-brand-gradient font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-2">
						A word from the dev
					</p>
					<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight dark:text-white mb-4">
						Built by a mermaid, musician & dungeon master
					</h2>
					<div class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 space-y-3 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
						<p>
							Hello and welcome to Neverkin! I'm Maija - the founder and solo dev behind this app, as well as
							a mermaid, musician and a DM from the title. I am all three people, yes. Neverkin has been my
							hobby project since early 2022, and I'm happy to finally share it with you!
						</p>
						<p>
							I take maintainability, architecture and security seriously, and Neverkin is optimized for
							long-term maintenance and development experience. I have even built a little custom framework to
							support it!
						</p>
						<p>
							If you encounter issues or have ideas for new features, please don't hesitate to reach out or
							submit a pull request! Contributions are very welcome, and if you're a dev, you should be able
							to get a local dev environment up and running in a single command.
						</p>
						<p>
							Neverkin is free from ads and credit cards, and I'm committed to keeping it that way. If you
							wish to support the project, the best thing you can do today is to share it with those who might
							find it useful!
						</p>
					</div>
